    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "The ratio of the cost of a shirt to the cost of a tie is $8:5$. If the shirt costs $\\$48$ more than the tie, find the cost of the shirt and the cost of the tie.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
