      "worked": "The difference in costs represents $8-5=3$ equal parts.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Value of 3 parts}&=\\$48\\\\\\text{Value of 1 part}&=\\$48\\div3\\\\\\text{Value of 1 part}&=\\$16\\\\\\text{Cost of shirt}&=8\\times\\$16=\\$128\\\\\\text{Cost of tie}&=5\\times\\$16=\\$80\\end{align*}$$",
